    },
    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "C OPRA works by **serializing the proof state** and **executing tactics** in the underlying proof environment. The agent uses **feedback from the execution** to inform its next move, and can also **retrieve relevant lemmas and definitions** from an external database. This process is repeated until a proof is found or the search space is exhausted.",
