      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "C OPRA has been evaluated on the **miniF2F** benchmark for Lean and a set of Coq tasks from the **CompCert** project. The results show that C OPRA **significantly outperforms** few-shot invocations of the language model and **compares favorably** to finetuned approaches.",
