    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "C OPRA has the potential to **revolutionize formal theorem-proving** by providing a **domain-agnostic** and **in-context learning** approach. This can enable **faster proof discovery** and **improved mathematical understanding**. The approach can also be **extended to other domains**, such as software verification and natural language processing.",
